{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423440001:1":{"text":"흑흑... 모모가 돌아왔어요! 찾아주셔서 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"呜呜……咪咪回来了！谢谢你们找到它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAD528D2DC8EDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423440002:1":{"text":"잠깐! 네가 말한 그 \"모모\"는 이 몸이 잃은 애완동물이었거늘! 어디서 얻은 것이냐?","source_cn":"站住！汝口中所谓“咪咪”，乃吾遗失之家宠！汝从何处得来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB81AD1DFA8952BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423440003:1":{"text":"저게 무슨 말이에요...?","source_cn":"他说的话是什么意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B133AE3B7AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423440004:1":{"text":"모모를 자기가 잃어버린 애완동물이라면서 어디서 데려왔냐고 하는데...","source_cn":"他说咪咪是他丢失的宠物，问你从哪里得到的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCD9517FF42D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423440005:1":{"text":"흑... 모모는 제가 풀숲에서 주운 아이예요. 그땐 너무 말라서 제가 열심히 돌봤는데...","source_cn":"呜……咪咪是我在草丛里捡到的，那个时候它很瘦，我把它照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EB28A4DABF34C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1423440006:1":{"text":"헛소리! 이 몸의 애완동물로 호강하면서 지냈거늘! 네가 일부러 훔쳐간 것이지? 근위병, 가서 이 몸의... 아니, 애완동물을 찾아오너라!","source_cn":"满口胡言！吾之家宠养尊处优，定是你蓄意拐跑！侍卫，替吾...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4629DC775DA3FF9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:哭泣的平民女孩":{"text":"울고 있는 평민 소녀","source":"哭泣的平民女孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:骄傲的贵族男孩":{"text":"오만한 귀족 소년","source":"骄傲的贵族男孩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}